useCapability chatReportHandler jwtTokenSigner
purpose operation chatReportHandler "Guard the registered chat report command route until full report persistence is wired."
invariant operation chatReportHandler "The registered command route enforces Idempotency-Key before auth and does not mutate chat state in this placeholder."
label startChatReportHandler
call chatReportIdempotencyCall http.requestHeader
argument chatReportIdempotencyCall request HttpRequest request
argument chatReportIdempotencyCall name CNullTerminatedByteString runtime.idempotencyKeyHeaderName
run chatReportIdempotencyCall
bind value chatReportIdempotencyKey CNullTerminatedByteString chatReportIdempotencyCall
call chatReportIdempotencyMissingCall pointer.isNull
argument chatReportIdempotencyMissingCall ptr COpaqueMemoryAddress chatReportIdempotencyKey
run chatReportIdempotencyMissingCall
bind value chatReportIdempotencyMissing Bool chatReportIdempotencyMissingCall
branch if condition chatReportIdempotencyMissing target chatReportMissingIdempotencyKey
call chatReportAuthCall requestHasBidderBearerToken
argument chatReportAuthCall request HttpRequest request
run chatReportAuthCall
bind value chatReportAuthenticated Bool chatReportAuthCall
branch if condition chatReportAuthenticated target chatReportAuthenticatedAccepted
branch else target chatReportUnauthorized
label chatReportAuthenticatedAccepted
call chatReportAuctionIdParamCall http.requestPathParam
argument chatReportAuctionIdParamCall request HttpRequest request
argument chatReportAuctionIdParamCall name CNullTerminatedByteString runtime.auctionIdParamName
run chatReportAuctionIdParamCall
bind value chatReportAuctionId CNullTerminatedByteString chatReportAuctionIdParamCall
call chatReportAuctionIdMissingCall pointer.isNull
argument chatReportAuctionIdMissingCall ptr COpaqueMemoryAddress chatReportAuctionId
run chatReportAuctionIdMissingCall
bind value chatReportAuctionIdMissing Bool chatReportAuctionIdMissingCall
branch if condition chatReportAuctionIdMissing target chatReportValidationFailed
call chatReportMessageIdParamCall http.requestPathParam
argument chatReportMessageIdParamCall request HttpRequest request
argument chatReportMessageIdParamCall name CNullTerminatedByteString runtime.fieldMessageId
run chatReportMessageIdParamCall
bind value chatReportMessageId CNullTerminatedByteString chatReportMessageIdParamCall
call chatReportMessageIdMissingCall pointer.isNull
argument chatReportMessageIdMissingCall ptr COpaqueMemoryAddress chatReportMessageId
run chatReportMessageIdMissingCall
bind value chatReportMessageIdMissing Bool chatReportMessageIdMissingCall
branch if condition chatReportMessageIdMissing target chatReportValidationFailed
branch else target chatReportMessageNotFound
label chatReportMissingIdempotencyKey
call chatReportMissingIdemWriteCall helpers.writeMissingIdempotencyKeyEnvelope
argument chatReportMissingIdemWriteCall response HttpResponse response
run chatReportMissingIdemWriteCall
bind value chatReportMissingIdemWriteStatus CSignedInt32 chatReportMissingIdemWriteCall
return value chatReportMissingIdemWriteStatus
label chatReportUnauthorized
call chatReportUnauthorizedWriteCall helpers.writeUnauthorizedEnvelope
argument chatReportUnauthorizedWriteCall response HttpResponse response
run chatReportUnauthorizedWriteCall
bind value chatReportUnauthorizedWriteStatus CSignedInt32 chatReportUnauthorizedWriteCall
return value chatReportUnauthorizedWriteStatus
label chatReportValidationFailed
call chatReportValidationWriteCall helpers.writeValidationFailedEnvelope
argument chatReportValidationWriteCall response HttpResponse response
run chatReportValidationWriteCall
bind value chatReportValidationWriteStatus CSignedInt32 chatReportValidationWriteCall
return value chatReportValidationWriteStatus
label chatReportMessageNotFound
call chatReportMessageNotFoundWriteCall helpers.writeMessageNotFoundEnvelope
argument chatReportMessageNotFoundWriteCall response HttpResponse response
run chatReportMessageNotFoundWriteCall
bind value chatReportMessageNotFoundWriteStatus CSignedInt32 chatReportMessageNotFoundWriteCall
return value chatReportMessageNotFoundWriteStatus
